      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Big_Bear_Lake%2C_California",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The first major resort, Pan Hot Springs Hotel, opened in 1921 on land that included a natural hot spring.",
